      *> EBCDIC_SIMBOLOS.COB - como o GnuCOBOL converte simbolos
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. EBCDICSIMB.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           ALPHABET ALFA-NATIVO IS NATIVE
           ALPHABET ALFA-EBCDIC IS EBCDIC.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-TEXTO                PIC X(10) VALUE "[]{}~^|!#@".
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       PRINCIPAL.
           INSPECT WS-TEXTO CONVERTING ALFA-NATIVO TO ALFA-EBCDIC
           DISPLAY FUNCTION HEX-OF(WS-TEXTO)
           STOP RUN.
